msgid "the certificate is not valid yet."
msgstr "শংসাপত্রটি এখনও বৈধ নয়।"

#: src/io/w42-pdfsec.c:500
#, c-format
msgid "Word42 could not sign the PDF: %s"
msgstr "Word42 PDF-এ স্বাক্ষর করতে পারেনি: %s"

#. Translators: GnuTLS is the name of a program library;
#. * keep it as it is.
#. Translators: GnuTLS is the name of a program library; keep it
#. * as it is.
#: src/io/w42-pdfsec.c:530 src/ui/w42-dialogs.c:7704
#, c-format
